{"data": [{"author_id": "2108598498849656832", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:49:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117418965257339367"], "id": "2117418965257339367", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 纯代码手搓动画确实惊艳，不过 Fable 5.5 还没官宣，目前都是灰度用户的测试。更期待它在长任务稳定性和写代码上的提升，那才是日常最用得上的。", "url": "https://x.com/Linc3lls/status/2117418965257339367"}, {"author_id": "2007976461031096320", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:12:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117409423417389114"], "id": "2117409423417389114", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 代码做动画最大的变化是可以精确修改：视频模型生成的镜头，不满意只能重来碰运气；代码写的镜头，“角色晚 0.3 秒转身”就是改一个数。对做内容的人来说，可控比好看更值钱。", "url": "https://x.com/zhuhaotian512/status/2117409423417389114"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:34:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117384941172301976"], "id": "2117384941172301976", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 服了，纯代码搓出短片这手，真绝。感觉「语言即世界」这话越来越不夸张了。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117384941172301976"}, {"author_id": "1499198533106540546", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:14:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117379817888940414"], "id": "2117379817888940414", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 以前是“一图胜千言”，现在是“千行代码胜一图”。动画师看完默默打开了 Python 入门。", "url": "https://x.com/ajutqs/status/2117379817888940414"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:02:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117376948343390313"], "id": "2117376948343390313", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 真绝，一张图都不生纯靠代码搓66秒动画…语言模型这波已经在抢视频模型的饭了", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117376948343390313"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:36:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117370372475724116"], "id": "2117370372475724116", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 纯代码搓动画片，玛德我是真没想到能到这完成度。语言即世界这话今晚又坐实了", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117370372475724116"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:19:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117365926299660775"], "id": "2117365926299660775", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 玛德，纯代码搓动画都到这程度了，语言模型真把影像模型往死里卷", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117365926299660775"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:01:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117361405435523129"], "id": "2117361405435523129", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 特么的66秒片子它自己写了快3小时Python\n炸是炸，普通人要的是按一下就出、别中途跑飞", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117361405435523129"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:45:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117357400365666440"], "id": "2117357400365666440", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 笑死，纯代码手搓动画片这事放两年前谁信啊。语言即世界这句话这回算坐实了。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117357400365666440"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T20:03:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117346979714056559"], "id": "2117346979714056559", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 真绝，纯代码搓动画，\n比抽卡视频模型还离谱。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117346979714056559"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:45:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117342418756370869"], "id": "2117342418756370869", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 服了，语言模型纯代码手搓动画片…语言即世界这句不是吹的。普通人啥时候能一句话出片啊。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117342418756370869"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:16:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117335000374767691"], "id": "2117335000374767691", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 玛德，语言模型直接手搓动画这个方向我服了。语言即世界这句话越来越不像夸张了。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117335000374767691"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:59:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117330742216691828"], "id": "2117330742216691828", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 语言即世界这句真绝，代码能把动画整成片，模型边界又往外推了一截。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117330742216691828"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T18:39:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117325824559104007"], "id": "2117325824559104007", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 语言模型手搓动画这事我还是服，代码当画笔，语言真有点像世界接口了", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117325824559104007"}, {"author_id": "1164980832446111744", "created_at": "2026-11-02T17:02:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117301438321721520"], "id": "2117301438321721520", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 代码生成动画的价值，还在于角色、镜头和动作能否连续保持一致。", "url": "https://x.com/freedomledgerhq/status/2117301438321721520"}, {"author_id": "2107696398837612544", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:41:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117296112084320490"], "id": "2117296112084320490", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 代码级控制确实香，改色加事件秒生效；试下让 Claude 吐 GSAP 还能把几兆视频压到 20KB，蹲你测它导出的代码干不干净.", "url": "https://x.com/KiarenShin/status/2117296112084320490"}, {"author_id": "2075653799449169920", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:35:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117294655587193017"], "id": "2117294655587193017", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 我还在求 agent 别把我文件删了，人家已经让它拍动画片了。同样是写代码，两种命。", "url": "https://x.com/FloydBai/status/2117294655587193017"}, {"author_id": "1988475714501570561", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:33:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117294032615563636"], "id": "2117294032615563636", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 157, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge Claude走了另外一条生成视频的路线，而且好像还挺不错", "url": "https://x.com/liyue_ai/status/2117294032615563636"}, {"author_id": "1770630528548663296", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:15:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117289460467724354"], "id": "2117289460467724354", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 纯代码搓 66 秒动画、零生图，这个方向比「文生视频抽卡」稳多了。想问下 Fable 5.5 对中文分镜/旁白支持怎么样，有实测吗？", "url": "https://x.com/Henryyyyyy81/status/2117289460467724354"}, {"author_id": "2110767738407063552", "created_at": "2026-11-02T16:02:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117286210469339332"], "id": "2117286210469339332", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 68, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 以前做动画是一帧一帧画\n现在是一行一行写\n\n下一步是不是该给动画片做 code review 了", "url": "https://x.com/Lawery_rolin/status/2117286210469339332"}, {"author_id": "1482994078497267712", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:42:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117281122228842722"], "id": "2117281122228842722", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 102, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 一想到再过半年到一年后所有的AI就能普适强大到这种程度，就非很期待😋", "url": "https://x.com/vmvqhc/status/2117281122228842722"}, {"author_id": "1589127100153225216", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:35:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117279313682989467"], "id": "2117279313682989467", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 语言模型自己写 Python 手搓动画片，说明“代码”已经成了通用的创作中间层；下一个被重做的不是工具，而是整条内容生产线——你觉得先倒下的是哪个环节？", "url": "https://x.com/lg11572003/status/2117279313682989467"}, {"author_id": "2953739684", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:21:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117275794401853736"], "id": "2117275794401853736", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 用代码逐帧画，好处是每一帧都能改、能复现，这点视频模型很难做到。\n\n不过目前演示都来自个人账号，等正式开放才知道普通提示词能不能稳定出片。", "url": "https://x.com/AzrianoY1/status/2117275794401853736"}, {"author_id": "1643977766906494976", "created_at": "2026-11-02T15:01:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117271006150815864"], "id": "2117271006150815864", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 159, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 连声音都用代码做出来，这个例子挺有意思。想看看换个故事能不能稳定复现。", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Piscis/status/2117271006150815864"}, {"author_id": "1717809218731065344", "created_at": "2026-11-02T14:54:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117269006784815516"], "id": "2117269006784815516", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117249401534160933", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 用代码手搓动画片这事，我是真没想到语言模型能干到这份上。语言即世界这话，感觉越来越不夸张了。", "url": "https://x.com/libo_ai/status/2117269006784815516"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2108598498849656832", "name": "Linc", "username": "Linc3lls"}, {"id": "2007976461031096320", "name": "DeepInTheNight", "username": "zhuhaotian512"}, {"id": "1717809218731065344", "name": "AI速递 | 李博", "username": "libo_ai"}, {"id": "1499198533106540546", "name": "Ajut Q", "username": "ajutqs"}, {"id": "1164980832446111744", "name": "John｜The Freedom Ledger", "username": "freedomledgerhq"}, {"id": "2107696398837612544", "name": "Kiaren", "username": "KiarenShin"}, {"id": "2075653799449169920", "name": "幻相", "username": "FloydBai"}, {"id": "1988475714501570561", "name": "李岳", "username": "liyue_ai"}, {"id": "1770630528548663296", "name": "Henry（AI搞钱版）", "username": "Henryyyyyy81"}, {"id": "2110767738407063552", "name": "lawery_rolin", "username": "Lawery_rolin"}, {"id": "1482994078497267712", "name": "布朗尼蛋糕", "username": "vmvqhc"}, {"id": "1589127100153225216", "name": "BRUCE硬核视界", "username": "lg11572003"}, {"id": "2953739684", "name": "0xAzr", "username": "AzrianoY1"}, {"id": "1643977766906494976", "name": "Kalau", "username": "Miles_Piscis"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2117418965257339367", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyi9d0xkvt55heptu88xkum3q7x", "oldest_id": "2117269006784815516", "result_count": 25}}